SUMMARY:ASFAN course – Introduction to Ufology (1/14)
DESCRIPTION:The basics: unidentified aerospace/anomalous phenomena (UAP/UFO)\n\nUnidentified aerospace/anomalous phenomena (UAP/UFO)\, the basics: aerial\, underwater\, outer space\, transmedium. Daytime\, nighttime and radar sightings. Characteristics\, landings. Aggressive UFOs.\n\nOne hour of presentation\, one hour of discussion. Those admitted receive the ZOOM link by e-mail.\nDetails: https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s1
LOCATION:Online\, via ZOOM
URL:https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s1
