DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261202T170000Z
DTEND:20261202T190000Z
SUMMARY:ASFAN course – Introduction to Ufology (2/14)
DESCRIPTION:Political-military history 1942–2017\n\nPolitical-military history 1942-2017\, nuclear connections\, crashes\, conflicts\, projects\, Blue Book\, Hynek\, regulations. Secrecy\, disinformation\, taboo\, ridicule\, media complicity\, the UFO mythology. Also among the Russians\, British\, French\, South Americans etc.\n\nOne hour of presentation\, one hour of discussion. Those admitted receive the ZOOM link by e-mail.\nDetails: https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s2
LOCATION:Online\, via ZOOM
URL:https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s2
