DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261216T170000Z
DTEND:20261216T190000Z
SUMMARY:ASFAN course – Introduction to Ufology (3/14)
DESCRIPTION:After 2017: Congress\, Pentagon\, NASA\, AARO\n\nAfter 2017: Congress\, the Pentagon\, NASA\, AARO etc. Private initiatives. Has the American military industry used UFO debris? Russia\, China and ICER\, other associations. Official UFO structures. The latest declassifications.\n\nOne hour of presentation\, one hour of discussion. Those admitted receive the ZOOM link by e-mail.\nDetails: https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s3
LOCATION:Online\, via ZOOM
URL:https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s3
