SUMMARY:ASFAN course – Introduction to Ufology (4/14)
DESCRIPTION:Close encounters of the 3rd–4th kind\n\nClose encounters of the 3rd-4th kind. Contacts\, contactees\, abductions\, scenario\, genetic experiments\, indoctrination\, special characteristics\, evidence\, abductions without return. Hopkins\, Mack etc. Mutilations\, cryptozoology\, reservations?\n\nOne hour of presentation\, one hour of discussion. Those admitted receive the ZOOM link by e-mail.\nDetails: https://curs.asfan.online/en/#s4
